 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the inert geodesics at infra-scale s through a germ, a vertex list; \
InfraMeasurement reads its graph, the window graph of the forward extensions, \
RandomInfraGeodesic the inextensible simple ones"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"aad0cadf-c55f-4459-b795-8f51ceb93386"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
